# The rocket launcher, at a target eight units away that stands still: the first
# rocket is aimed at the ground short of it and the blast reaches it from a
# little way off, with the damage the distance leaves; the second is aimed at
# the target itself. A rocket flies for ticks (0.4 units each), and what it deals
# is an explosion's: within its radius, at a scale that falls to nothing at the
# cutoff. Two rockets are in the launcher, and it reloads when they are gone (the
# third is fired when it has).
scenario rocket_blast
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
target 85.9 -166.2 0.32 3.14159265
weapon weapons/rocket launcher/rocket launcher
ticks 460
input 0 100 pitch=-0.115
input 100 420 pitch=-0.075
input 60 63 fire=1
input 160 163 fire=1
input 330 333 fire=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
tolerance shots 0
tolerance age 0
